=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ LIBSSH2 @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt libssh2 @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt libssh2 is free software under the BSD-3-Clause licence; see COPYING.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [LIBSSH2.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for libssh2
    At system startup: to define LIBSSH2$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:LIBSSH2$STARTUP.COM
    To build with it: compile with /INCLUDE=LIBSSH2$ROOT:[INCLUDE] and
    /NAMES=(AS_IS,SHORTENED), link with LIBSSH2$ROOT:[LIB]LIBSSH2/OPTIONS.

PRODUCT REMOVE LIBSSH2 removes the product and deassigns LIBSSH2$ROOT.
